# UI migration scope

## Owner direction superseding historical shell locks (2026-11-10)

The owner authorized complete Odoo retirement. The historical Odoo shell locks below are superseded: migrate each route to Orithos-native APIs while preserving its existing workflow and permissions. Do not keep Odoo as a runtime fallback. Do not remove a route's workflow until its Orithos replacement is implemented and accepted.

The owner repeatedly asked to keep the full operational shells for Sell / Stock. Do **not** replace these route targets with `Native*` or stripped pages unless the owner explicitly asks in the current chat.

| Route | Required component |
|-------|--------------------|
| `/`, `/sell`, `/register` | `OdooRegisterPage` |
| `/close` | `OdooCloseRegisterPage` |
| `/products` | `OdooProductCataloguePage` (More / totals / Load more) |
| `/purchases` | `PurchasingWorkspace` (Orders / Invoices / Suppliers / Replenishment tabs) |
| `/customers` | `OdooCustomerDirectoryPage` |
| `/suppliers` | `SupplierDirectoryPage` from `OdooSupplierDirectoryPage` |
| `/dashboard` | `OrithosOverviewPage` |

## Reports exception (Shopfront browser source retired)

`/api/shopfront-source` returns **410**. Do not reintroduce `ShopfrontReportsOverviewPage` or `ShopfrontSourceDataPage` on live report routes unless that API is restored.

| Route | Required component |
|-------|--------------------|
| `/reports/dashboard` | `NativeReportsDashboardPage` |
| `/reports/sales` | `NativeSalesReportPage` |
| `/reports/inventory` | `NativeInventoryReportPage` |
| `/reports/purchase` | redirect to `/purchases` |
| `/reports/shopfront/dashboard` | redirect to `/reports/dashboard` |

Keep `pos-ui/src/lib/native-pos-host.ts` with an **empty** `NATIVE_POS_HOSTS` set while sell uses the Odoo register.

Ledger/backend native work may continue, but must not silently rewire the Sell/Stock/Customers shells above.
